## h i g h l i g h t s
MOF-based wood air filters were prepared and applied to air filtration. MOF particles were attached tightly to the wood channel matrix.  Compound air filters can effectively remove particulate matter.  The trapping mechanism of particulate matter by MOF in wood cavity was proposed.
